      "content": "\"sitting with the emptiness\" doesn't really help when the emptiness is what's killing me. i'm just tired of being here. i feel like i've reached the end of the line and everyone is just waiting for me to pretend i'm okay, but i'm not. i don't think i ever will be. it would just be easier if i wasn't a burden to everyone anymore.",
